<title>HONG KONG: Peace Hill 1996 net loss HK$12.26 mln.</title>
<headline>Peace Hill 1996 net loss HK$12.26 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	 19.1 loss  vs 8.6 loss</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)  nil	  vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	2.60 gain  vs 0.62 loss</p>
<p>    Net			  12.26 loss vs 5.53 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover		   30.60	vs 9.79</p>
<p>    Company name	     Peace Hill Enterprise Group Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	 N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Peace Hill Enterprise is a beverages manufacturer and distributor.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain on revaluation of investment properties.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is nil vs nil.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
